# Mistralton City (the airfield town where the wind never rests: planes on the apron, greenhouses round the runway, a Gym in
# a hangar): a sprightly flute tune in G over strings, a plucked bounce, a springy bass and a bright beat, brisk as a take-off
# run. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U7, part a).
